{"slug":"negativeverbs_ex","title":"动词否定活用练习","section":"基本语法","html":" <h2 id=\"part1\">本节使用的词汇</h2><p>下面的动词跟上一次练习相同。我们用相同的动词来进行否定活用练习。</p><div class=\"sumbox\"><span class=\"summary\">汉字</span><br> 我先列出的是新单词里要用到的汉字。点击汉字可以跳到学习笔画的页面。如果你对笔顺没把握的话，建议查字典。我建议在单词中学习汉字（比如后面那些）。 <ol><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2544_%B8%AB\" rel=\"noopener\">見</a> - 看</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?3551_%CD%E8\" rel=\"noopener\">来</a> - 来；下一个</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?0212_%B9%D4\" rel=\"noopener\">行</a> - 去；进行</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?0130_%B5%A2\" rel=\"noopener\">帰</a> - 回家</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2075_%BF%A9\" rel=\"noopener\">食</a> - 吃；食物</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?1692_%B0%FB\" rel=\"noopener\">飲</a> - 喝</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2598_%C7%E3\" rel=\"noopener\">買</a> - 买</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2196_%C7%E4\" rel=\"noopener\">売</a> - 卖</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?0374_%BB%FD\" rel=\"noopener\">持</a> - 抓住</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?0364_%C2%D4\" rel=\"noopener\">待</a> - 等待</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?1541_%C6%C9\" rel=\"noopener\">読</a> - 读</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2416_%CA%E2\" rel=\"noopener\">歩</a> - 走</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?2194_%C1%F6\" rel=\"noopener\">走</a> - 跑</li><li><a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwhalsod.cgi?3142_%CD%B7\" rel=\"noopener\">遊</a> - 玩</li></ol></div><div class=\"sumbox\"><span class=\"summary\">词汇学习</span><br><br>下面是一些你迟早要学会的常用动词。 <ol><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\">する</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">suru</span>- 做</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\">しゃべる</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">shaberu</span>- 谈话；聊天</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">miru</span> - 看</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kuru</span> - 来</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">iku</span> - 去</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kaeru</span> - 回家</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べる</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">taberu</span> - 吃</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>む</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">nomu</span> - 喝</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kau</span> - 买</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">uru</span> - 卖</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kiru</span> - 切</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">hairu</span> - 进入</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">deru</span> - 出来</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">motsu</span> - 抓住</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>待<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">matsu</span> - 等待</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kaku</span> - 书写</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>む</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">yomu</span> - 读</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>歩<rp>(</rp><rt>ある</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">aruku</span> - 走</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">hashiru</span> - 跑</li><li class=\"vocab\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>遊<rp>(</rp><rt>あそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぶ</span><span class=\"ro\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">asobu</span> - 玩</li></ol></div><h2 id=\"part2\">练习动词否定式活用</h2><p>我们在上一个练习里学习了动词分类，现在我们要依据分类来进行否定式活用。第一行是示例。</p><div id=\"exercise1\"><p></p><table class=\"table table-condensed\"><tbody><tr><td>动词</td><td>否定式</td></tr><tr><td>行く<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">iku</span></td><td class=\"answerline\">行かない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">ikanai</span></td></tr><tr><td>出る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">deru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">出ない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">denai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>する<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">suru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">しない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">shinai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>買う<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kau</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">買わない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kawanai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>売る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">uru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">売らない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">uranai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>食べる<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">taberu</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">食べない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">tabenai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>入る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">hairu</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">入らない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">hairanai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>来る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kuru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">こない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">konai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>飲む<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">nomu</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">飲まない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">nomanai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>しゃべる<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">shaberu</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">しゃべらない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">shaberanai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>見る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">miru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">見ない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">minai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>切る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kiru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">切らない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kiranai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>帰る<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kaeru</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">帰らない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kaeranai</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>書く<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kaku</span></td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">書かない<span class=\"ro ro-b\" lang=\"ja-Latn\">kakanai</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><div class=\"sumbox\"><a data-reveal=\"exercise1\" href=\"#\">切换显示答案</a></div></div> ","orig":"http://guidetojapanese.org/learn/grammar/negativeverbs_ex"}